{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54412","headline":"赠齐己（题拟） · 郑谷","name":"赠齐己（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敲门谁访□，□客即□师。\n应是逢新雪，高吟得好诗。\n格清无俗字，思苦有苍髭。\n讽味但忘倦，抛琴复舍碁。\n（见《四部丛刊》本《白莲集》卷首孙光宪《白莲集序》引。\n此首承赵昌平同志录志。\n）（〖1〗《白莲集序》：「郑谷郎中与师□□□□□□〖下引诗，略〗其爲诗家流之之称许也如此。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}